  "comment": [
    "Terms that must not appear in the Traditional Chinese files.",
    "Three groups: wording that is Mainland rather than Taiwanese, the",
    "forms OpenCC produces that Taiwan does not use, and terms that are",
    "only wrong outside the contexts listed in 'allow'.",
    "Checked by rel/i18n-tr/lint-zh-TW.py in emqx.git and by",
    "scripts/i18n/lint-zh-TW.mjs in emqx-dashboard5.git; keep the two",
    "copies of this file identical.",
    "A rule may carry 'allow' (contexts where the term is fine) and 'allowKeyPrefix' (entries where it is fine).",
    "'simplifiedChars' are the Simplified characters this corpus actually uses, so the check needs no OpenCC at run time. Regenerate it when the Simplified source grows new ones."
  ],
